# Normalize all text files to LF in the repo and on checkout.
# Without this, Windows core.autocrlf=true checks out CRLF, and Prettier
# (endOfLine defaults to "lf") fails every file — breaking `npm run lint`
# and the pre-commit hook for any Windows contributor.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Known binaries — never normalize.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.webp binary
*.woff  binary
*.woff2 binary
